(i). ${\bf x}_{t_1}^{\bf a}$ and ${\bf x}_{t_2}^{\bf f}$ have the same support, i.e., $Su({\bf x}_{t_1}^{\bf a})=Su({\bf x}_{t_2}^{\bf f})$;

(ii). $x_{i;t_1}=x_{j;t_2}$ implies $a_i=f_j$.

